    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strafing_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strafing Attack\">Strafing Attack</a> without a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you make an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> attack, instead of attacking a 2-square-by-2-square area, you may attack a line 1 square wide and 4 squares long.</p><p><b>Special:</b> If you are using a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jet_Pack\" title=\"Jet Pack\">Jet Pack</a>, you can use the Strafe feat to make an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> attack against all squares you fly over.</p>",
